  "content": "<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h1 id=\"wb-cont\">Government of Canada services</h1>\n</div>\n<section class=\"bg-light mt-3 pb-3\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h2 class=\"h3 mb-4\">Most requested</h2>\n<ul class=\"list-unstyled colcount-md-3 colcount-no-break compact bold-content lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng\">\n<li><a data-gc-analytics-mostrequested=\"manualTag\" href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/government/sign-in-online-account.html\">Sign in to an account</a></li>\n<li><a data-gc-analytics-mostrequested=\"manualTag\" href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/sin.html\">Social Insurance Number (<abbr>SIN</abbr>)</a></li>\n<li><a data-gc-analytics-mostrequested=\"manualTag\" href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/dental/dental-care-plan.html\">Canadian Dental Care Plan</a></li>\n<li><a data-gc-analytics-mostrequested=\"manualTag\" href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/programs/ei/ei-list/ei-roe.html\">Record of employment (<abbr>ROE</abbr>)</a></li>\n<li><a data-gc-analytics-mostrequested=\"manualTag\" href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/government/grants-funding.html\">Find grants and funding</a></li>\n<li><a data-gc-analytics-mostrequested=\"manualTag\" href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/jobs/opportunities.html\">Find a job</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n<section class=\"pb-3\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h2 class=\"h3 mb-4\">By category</h2>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Employment Insurance and leave</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/ei/employment-insurance-reporting.html\">Submit an Employment Insurance Report</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/ei/ei-regular-benefit/apply.html\">Apply for Employment Insurance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/ei/ei-regular-benefit/after-applying.html\">Check your Employment Insurance (<abbr>EI</abbr>) claim</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/family.html\">Maternity, parental, and caregiving benefits and leave</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/ei/ei-sickness.html\">Sickness benefits and leave</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Benefits, dental care and other financial support</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/disability.html\">Disability benefits</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/dental/dental-care-plan.html\">Canadian Dental Care Plan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/education/student-aid.html\">Student aid</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/child-family-benefits/canada-child-benefit.html\">Canada Child Benefit (<abbr>CCB</abbr>)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/child-family-benefits/canada-workers-benefit.html\">Canada Workers Benefit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/government/grants-funding.html\">Find grants and funding</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/housing.html\">Housing benefits</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/child-and-family-benefits.html\">Tax credits for individuals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/finder.html\">Benefits finder</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Passports for Canadians</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/canadian-passports/renew-adult-passport.html\">Renew a Canadian passport</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/canadian-passports/check-passport-travel-document-application.html\">Check the status of a passport application</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/canadian-passports/new-adult-passport.html\">Apply for a new Canadian passport</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Retirement pensions (<abbr title=\"Canada Pension Plan\">CPP</abbr>, <abbr title=\"Old Age Security\">OAS</abbr>, <abbr title=\"Guaranteed Income Supplement\">GIS</abbr>)</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/calendar.html\">Pension payment dates</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/publicpensions/cpp/retirement-income-calculator.html\">Canadian Retirement Income Calculator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/publicpensions/old-age-security/payments.html\">Old Age Security (<abbr>OAS</abbr>) - Estimate payment amounts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/publicpensions/cpp/amount.html\">Canada Pension Plan (<abbr>CPP</abbr>) - How much you could receive</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/my-account/cpp.html\">View payment amounts in My Service Canada Account (<abbr>MSCA</abbr>)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/benefits/publicpensions/old-age-security/guaranteed-income-supplement.html\">Guaranteed Income Supplement (<abbr>GIS</abbr>)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/retirement.html\">Learn and plan for your retirement</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Come to Canada</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/work-canada/work-permit.html\">Apply for a work permit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/visit-canada/visitor-visa.html\">Apply for a visitor visa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/visit-canada/eta.html\">Apply for an Electronic Travel Authorization (<abbr>eTA</abbr>)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/study-canada/study-permit.html\">Apply for a study permit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/application/check-status.html\">Check your application status</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/application/check-processing-times.html\">Check processing times</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/express-entry.html\">Immigrate through Express Entry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees.html\">Immigrate as a provincial nominee</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/application/ircc-accounts.html\"><abbr title=\"Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada\">IRCC</abbr> accounts - sign in or register</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/family-sponsorship.html\">Sponsor your family members to immigrate to Canada</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/corporate/contact-ircc.html\">Contact Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Personal taxes</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/cra-login-services.html\">Access your <abbr title=\"Canada Revenue Agency\">CRA</abbr> account</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/digital-services-individuals/account-individuals/online-mail-individuals.html\">Check your mail from the <abbr title=\"Canada Revenue Agency\">CRA</abbr></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/income-tax/personal-income-tax/how-file.html\">File your tax return</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/individuals/topics/about-your-tax-return/tax-return/completing-a-tax-return/tax-slips/a-copy-your-tax-slips.html\">View or download a T4 and other tax slips</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes/income-tax/personal-income-tax/after-you-file/noa-nor.html#get\">Get a copy of a notice of assessment or reassessment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/forms-publications/publications/rc4466/tax-free-savings-account-tfsa-guide-individuals.html#P44_1120\">Find your Tax-Free Savings Account (<abbr>TFSA</abbr>) contribution limit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/individuals/topics/about-your-tax-return/refunds.html\">Find out when you can expect your tax refund</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/payments/payments-cra.html\">Make a payment to the <abbr title=\"Canada Revenue Agency\">CRA</abbr></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/individuals/topics/about-your-tax-return/tax-return/completing-a-tax-return/deductions-credits-expenses.html\">Find out which tax deductions, credits, or expenses you can claim</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/individuals/topics/rrsps-related-plans/contributing-a-rrsp-prpp/where-you-find-your-rrsp-prpp-deduction-limit.html\">Find your Registered Retirement Savings Plan (<abbr>RRSP</abbr>) contribution limit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/cra-login-services/register-cra-sign-in-services.html\">Open a My Account</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/individuals/segments/tax-credits-deductions-persons-disabilities/disability-tax-credit.html\">Disability tax credit</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Business taxes</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/gst-hst-businesses/file-gst-hst-return.html\">File a <abbr title=\"Goods and Services Tax\">GST</abbr>/<abbr title=\"Harmonized Sales Tax\">HST</abbr> return</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/payments/payments-cra.html\">Make a payment to the <abbr title=\"Canada Revenue Agency\">CRA</abbr></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/digital-services-businesses/payroll-deductions-online-calculator.html\">Calculate payroll deductions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/forms-publications/publications/rc4120/employers-guide-filing-t4-slip-summary.html\">File an employer information return (T4 Summary)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/cra-login-services.html\">Access your <abbr title=\"Canada Revenue Agency\">CRA</abbr> account</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Canadian citizenship and permanent resident cards</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/canadian-citizenship.html\">Apply for Canadian citizenship</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/application/check-status.html\">Check your application status</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/permanent-residents/card.html\">Get, renew or replace a permanent resident card</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Alerts and advisories</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://weather.gc.ca/mainmenu/alert_menu_e.html\">Weather alerts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://travel.gc.ca/travelling/advisories\">Travel advice and advisories</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://recalls-rappels.canada.ca/en\">Recalls and safety alerts</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Online accounts (update banking or address, get access or help)</h3>\n</summary>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/government/sign-in-online-account.html\">Sign in to an account</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/government/change-address.html\">Change your address</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/public-services-procurement/services/payments-to-from-government/direct-deposit.html\">Set up or change your direct deposit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/my-account/find-pac.html\">Personal Access Code (<abbr>PAC</abbr>) for My Service Canada Account</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/government/sign-in-online-account/gckey.html\">GCKey help</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/cra-login-services/help-cra-sign-in-services.html?type=myacct\">Help with using your <abbr title=\"Canada Revenue Agency\">CRA</abbr> account</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>\n<h3 class=\"h5\">Provincial or territorial government (birth certificates, marriage licenses, driver's licenses, health cards)</h3>\n</summary>\n<p>Many services are the responsibility of your provincial or territorial government.</p>\n<ul class=\"colcount-md-2 lst-spcd-2 fnt-hdng mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-md\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.alberta.ca/\">Alberta</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/home\">British Columbia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gov.mb.ca/\">Manitoba</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gnb.ca/en.html\">New Brunswick</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gov.nl.ca/\">Newfoundland and Labrador</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.novascotia.ca/\">Nova Scotia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.ontario.ca/page/government-ontario\">Ontario</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.princeedwardisland.ca/en\">Prince Edward Island</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.quebec.ca/en\">Quebec</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.saskatchewan.ca/\">Saskatchewan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gov.nt.ca/\">Northwest Territories</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gov.nu.ca/en\">Nunavut</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://yukon.ca/en\">Yukon</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<section class=\"gc-srvinfo\">\n<h2>By theme</h2>\n<div class=\"wb-eqht-grd row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/jobs.html\">Jobs</a></h3>\n<p>Find a job, training, hiring programs, work permits, Social Insurance Number <abbr title=\"Social Insurance Number\">SIN</abbr></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/immigration-citizenship.html\">Immigration and citizenship</a></h3>\n<p>Visit, work, study, immigrate, refugees, permanent residents, apply, check status</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"https://travel.gc.ca/\">Travel and tourism</a></h3>\n<p>In Canada or abroad, advice, advisories, passports, visit Canada, events, attractions</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/business.html\">Business and industry</a></h3>\n<p>Starting a business, permits, copyright, business support, selling to government</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/benefits.html\">Benefits</a></h3>\n<p><abbr title=\"Employment Insurance\">EI</abbr>, family and sickness leave, child benefit, pensions, housing, student aid, disabilities, after a death</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/health.html\">Health</a></h3>\n<p>Food, nutrition, diseases, vaccines, drugs, product safety and recalls</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes.html\">Taxes</a></h3>\n<p>Income tax, payroll, <abbr title=\"Goods and Services Tax\">GST</abbr>/<abbr title=\"Harmonized Sales Tax\">HST</abbr>, contribution limits, tax credits, charities</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/environment.html\">Environment and natural resources</a></h3>\n<p>Weather, climate, agriculture, wildlife, pollution, conservation, fisheries</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/defence.html\">National security and defence</a></h3>\n<p>Military, transportation and cyber security, securing the border, counter-terrorism</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/culture.html\">Culture, history and sport</a></h3>\n<p>Arts, media, heritage, official languages, national identity and funding</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/policing.html\">Policing, justice and emergencies</a></h3>\n<p>Safety, justice system, prepare for emergencies, services for victims of crime</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/transport.html\">Transport and infrastructure</a></h3>\n<p>Aviation, marine, road and rail, car seat and vehicle recalls</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"http://international.gc.ca/world-monde/index.aspx?lang=eng\">Canada and the world</a></h3>\n<p>Foreign policy, trade agreements, development work, global issues</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/finance.html\">Money and finances</a></h3>\n<p>Personal finance, credit reports, fraud protection, paying for education, housing</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/science.html\">Science and innovation</a></h3>\n<p>Scientific research on health, environment and space, grants and funding</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"/en/services/life-events.html\">Manage life events</a></h3>\n<p>Benefits and resources to help navigate life's biggest transitions</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<section class=\"gc-srvinfo\">\n<h2>Focus on</h2>\n<div class=\"wb-eqht-grd row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/indigenous-peoples.html\">Indigenous Peoples</a></h3>\n<p>Programs and services for First Nations, Inuit and Métis</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/veterans-military.html\">Veterans and military</a></h3>\n<p>Services for current and former military, <abbr title=\"Royal Canadian Mounted Police\">RCMP</abbr> and their families</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\">\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/youth.html\">Youth</a></h3>\n<p>Programs and services for teenagers and young adults</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>"
